WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 37

01:39.010 --> 01:40.030
If you don't hide,

01:40.050 --> 01:41.630
with more rotten vegetables and worn-out shoes coming,

01:41.650 --> 01:43.840
it's not so honorable, either.

01:43.860 --> 01:45.180
So I'll dishonor

01:45.180 --> 01:46.670
my country either way.

01:46.690 --> 01:50.000
I just can't quell the public anger.

01:50.330 --> 01:52.160
You're really good.

01:52.180 --> 01:53.730
You misunderstood me.

01:55.180 --> 01:56.600
Wait!

01:57.300 --> 01:58.680
Gao.

02:01.980 --> 02:03.330
There's a long roll of cloth on the carriage

02:03.330 --> 02:04.520
which carries cargoes.

02:04.540 --> 02:05.520
Bring it to me.

02:05.540 --> 02:07.000
Yes, Your Excellency.

02:17.370 --> 02:18.730
Your Excellency.

02:21.210 --> 02:23.920
Wang, drive steadily.

02:24.420 --> 02:25.640
I got it.

02:52.540 --> 02:53.630
Everyone,

02:53.650 --> 02:56.290
this is the battle flag of the seventh battalion of

02:56.290 --> 02:57.960
our frontier forces.

02:57.980 --> 02:59.180
For the border war,

02:59.180 --> 03:00.620
this is the first flag

03:00.620 --> 03:02.010
put on

03:02.010 --> 03:03.760
your territory.

03:10.420 --> 03:11.400
Your Excellency,

03:11.420 --> 03:13.120
it's dangerous to incur the public anger.

03:13.140 --> 03:15.480
If you do so, I can't help you.

03:22.450 --> 03:23.970
Gao,

03:24.140 --> 03:25.320
borrow me your sword.

03:25.340 --> 03:26.760
OK.

03:32.370 --> 03:33.760
Now,

03:34.450 --> 03:35.370
this battle flag will also

03:35.370 --> 03:37.760
be taken into your imperial palace.

03:37.780 --> 03:39.840
This can make a much-told story.

03:41.140 --> 03:42.910
Only the weak keep talking.

03:42.930 --> 03:44.470
Whoever with courage and uprightness

03:44.490 --> 03:47.040
should knock me down

03:47.060 --> 03:48.760
and break the flagpole.

03:48.820 --> 03:49.830
However,

03:49.850 --> 03:51.450
I'm afraid there's no such man

03:51.450 --> 03:53.370
in Beiqi anymore.

04:03.420 --> 04:05.090
I'm Zhao Zhelin from Huxiao Battalion

04:05.090 --> 04:06.450
of Palace Guards.

04:24.770 --> 04:26.410
Next.

04:35.170 --> 04:36.470
Your Majesty,

04:36.490 --> 04:37.910
news comes from palace guards that

04:37.930 --> 04:39.350
Fan Xian, the Nanqing envoy,

04:39.370 --> 04:40.720
stands on the carriage roof

04:40.740 --> 04:42.030
and provokes the public by putting on the battle flag.

04:42.050 --> 04:44.000
He's so arrogant and rebellious!

04:44.020 --> 04:45.240
Your Majesty, please issue

04:45.260 --> 04:47.130
an imperial edict to reprimand him!

04:55.820 --> 04:57.120
Your Majesty,

04:57.140 --> 04:58.630
an urgent report from the border says that

04:58.650 --> 05:00.870
all the divisions of Nanqing's border forces

05:00.890 --> 05:02.260
have moved forward 15 km at the same time,

05:02.260 --> 05:04.600
and stopped right on the border line.

05:07.170 --> 05:09.250
Haven't we reached an agreement in the peace talk?

05:09.740 --> 05:12.030
If the war is restarted, the common people will suffer.

05:12.050 --> 05:14.880
Given that the state treasury is empty,
we can't afford another war.

05:23.170 --> 05:24.350
Your Majesty,

05:24.370 --> 05:25.840
news comes from Ministry of War that

05:25.860 --> 05:27.070
with the Nanqing frontier forces pressing on to the border,

05:27.090 --> 05:28.440
Beiqi is thrown into a panic.

05:28.460 --> 05:29.590
They avoid us most of the time.

05:29.610 --> 05:31.130
There's no dispute so far.

05:31.580 --> 05:33.000
Tell the frontier forces

05:33.020 --> 05:34.070
to stay where they are.

05:34.090 --> 05:35.840
Don't charge or retreat.

05:35.860 --> 05:39.200
Then Beiqi will tremble with fear.

05:40.770 --> 05:42.480
According to time,

05:44.700 --> 05:45.540
Fan Xian should have arrived

05:45.540 --> 05:48.250
in the capital of Beiqi.

05:48.370 --> 05:50.690
He should if everything goes well.

05:52.090 --> 05:54.810
Will he cause any trouble?

05:56.770 --> 05:59.520
Your Majesty, are the frontier forces

05:59.540 --> 06:01.130
pressing on to the border for Fan Xian?

06:03.540 --> 06:05.850
He's the envoy of Nanqing.

06:06.490 --> 06:08.690
Even if he causes any trouble,

06:09.540 --> 06:12.880
there will be millions of frontier soldiers backing him up.

06:28.540 --> 06:31.010
Well done! Good work!

06:58.700 --> 07:00.880
Your Excellency, do you want a try?

07:02.890 --> 07:04.700
Whoever is shameless

07:04.700 --> 07:06.260
can make a sneak attack.

07:06.260 --> 07:08.200
I'll take it.

07:09.650 --> 07:11.690
Your Excellency, watch out!

07:22.520 --> 07:25.590
=He Daoren, Ninth Dan martial arts master of Beiqi=

07:28.460 --> 07:29.880
He Daoren.

07:30.020 --> 07:32.200
The Investigator's Office has his records.
He's a Ninth Dan martial arts master.

07:32.330 --> 07:34.030
Even a Ninth Dan martial arts master dares to block my way.

07:34.050 --> 07:35.320
Your Excellency,

07:35.580 --> 07:36.770
that Chen Jushu you killed

07:36.770 --> 07:38.290
is his apprentice.

07:42.650 --> 07:45.160
Are you here to avenge your apprentice's death?

07:49.610 --> 07:50.970
Your Excellency!

08:08.740 --> 08:10.400
You have profound vitality Qi.

08:10.420 --> 08:13.810
Next round, I'll kill you with my sword.

08:19.020 --> 08:21.400
How can you point your sword at the envoy?

08:21.420 --> 08:23.480
Where are your manners?

08:25.020 --> 08:26.410
Your Excellency,

08:26.700 --> 08:28.440
the imperial palace is right ahead.

08:28.700 --> 08:30.310
By making such provocation,

08:30.330 --> 08:32.650
do you want to restart the war?

08:45.020 --> 08:46.330
Let's go.

08:48.410 --> 08:50.080
I'm really scared.

08:50.100 --> 08:52.080
Will anyone throw things at me again?

08:52.100 --> 08:52.930
Your Excellency,

08:52.930 --> 08:54.640
you may stay here for a moment.

08:54.660 --> 08:56.520
I'll go ahead to get things ready.

08:57.100 --> 08:58.720
Your Excellency, please go ahead.

09:02.530 --> 09:04.400
Your Excellency, have you reached the Ninth Dan?

09:09.370 --> 09:11.040
You are injured!

09:13.410 --> 09:14.720
I'm fine.

09:15.140 --> 09:17.250
So you're close to the Ninth Dan!

09:18.610 --> 09:20.650
I've been practicing Overbearing Vitality Qi.

09:21.020 --> 09:23.130
What a cool name!

09:23.340 --> 09:25.640
It's special for its strong power.

09:25.660 --> 09:26.730
By fighting with Shangshan Hu

09:26.730 --> 09:27.820
and Haitang Duoduo along the way,

09:27.820 --> 09:29.250
I've made a breakthrough.

09:29.410 --> 09:30.950
Competing solely on the strength of vitality Qi,

09:30.970 --> 09:32.270
I can fight a Ninth Dan martial arts master.

09:32.290 --> 09:34.000
But I'm far behind in terms of subtle control.

09:34.020 --> 09:35.470
Your Excellency, no wonder

09:35.490 --> 09:38.450
you put the flag on the carriage roof.

09:38.900 --> 09:40.080
Why?

09:40.850 --> 09:42.000
I stood on the carriage roof

09:42.020 --> 09:44.000
to avoid bodily movements.

09:44.020 --> 09:44.850
If He Daoren

09:44.850 --> 09:45.880
wanted to knock me down,

09:45.900 --> 09:47.400
he had to go up.

09:47.730 --> 09:49.270
Competing solely on the strength of vitality Qi,

09:49.290 --> 09:50.950
it's to my advantage.

09:50.970 --> 09:52.800
If He Daoren attacked me with his sword again,

09:52.820 --> 09:53.780
I would have to step aside,

09:53.780 --> 09:55.270
or I would be severely injured.

09:55.290 --> 09:57.080
Then why did Shen Zhong

09:57.260 --> 09:59.150
stop him just now?

09:59.170 --> 10:01.210
I'm the envoy of Nanqing.

10:01.490 --> 10:04.210
If anything bad happens to me, there'll be a war.

10:04.340 --> 10:05.410
Now Beiqi can't afford

10:05.410 --> 10:06.830
another war.

10:06.850 --> 10:08.950
Shen Zhong uses Beiqi people to humiliate me

10:08.970 --> 10:11.080
so as to undermine the morale of our mission.

10:11.100 --> 10:12.050
But he dares not

10:12.050 --> 10:13.000
hurt me.

10:13.020 --> 10:13.700
At least,

10:13.700 --> 10:15.890
I can't be hurt under his protection.

10:16.410 --> 10:17.530
So we're

10:17.530 --> 10:19.080
in an invincible position.

10:19.610 --> 10:21.080
On this occasion,

10:21.100 --> 10:22.470
I'm afraid it might be difficult

10:22.490 --> 10:24.130
to fulfill our task this time.

10:47.410 --> 10:49.480
It's so big here.

10:55.410 --> 10:56.890
Well, guys,

10:57.340 --> 10:58.960
what do you think?

10:59.370 --> 11:01.010
It's solemn and magnificent.

11:01.370 --> 11:04.000
Beiqi is the most orthodox of all countries.

11:04.020 --> 11:06.030
Young and superficial as Nanqing is,

11:06.050 --> 11:08.330
you even copied our imperial palace.

11:08.900 --> 11:11.480
Though young and superficial, we actually won the war.

11:13.140 --> 11:14.470
Your Excellency, you have a sharp tongue.

11:14.490 --> 11:15.830
It's no worse than your martial arts skills.

11:15.850 --> 11:17.890
Your Excellency, I've learned that from you.

11:20.370 --> 11:21.510
Let's go.

11:21.530 --> 11:23.130
His Majesty is waiting for us.

11:25.260 --> 11:26.480
Let's go.

11:33.140 --> 11:34.400
Your Excellency.

11:35.340 --> 11:37.960
His Majesty only wants to see you.

11:42.610 --> 11:43.890
Let's go.

11:46.970 --> 11:50.250
The envoy of Nanqing is here.

12:03.410 --> 12:04.800
Nanqing envoy Fan Xian

12:04.820 --> 12:07.030
pays respects to Your Majesty of Beiqi.

12:07.050 --> 12:07.970
I hereby present the credentials

12:07.970 --> 12:10.370
personally drafted by His Majesty of Nanqing.

12:31.720 --> 12:34.710
=Zhan Doudou, Emperor of Beiqi=

12:41.290 --> 12:43.080
Mr. Fan, which chapter of your book

12:43.820 --> 12:45.810
have you finished lately?

13:04.140 --> 13:05.910
That's all for today.

13:05.930 --> 13:07.690
Ministers, you may leave.

13:10.370 --> 13:13.280
Yes, Your Majesty.

13:19.660 --> 13:21.130
Mr. Fan,

13:21.780 --> 13:23.000
you should stay

13:23.020 --> 13:24.920
and talk with me.

13:33.660 --> 13:35.450
You can come up.

13:51.700 --> 13:54.250
Wang, it seems that the officials are all out.

13:56.260 --> 13:57.720
Your Excellency!

13:58.730 --> 14:00.720
Where's His Excellency?

14:04.660 --> 14:05.950
What has he done?

14:05.970 --> 14:07.030
Man and woman falling in love with each other,

14:07.050 --> 14:08.440
it's human nature.

14:08.460 --> 14:09.950
What are you talking about?

14:09.970 --> 14:11.520
What are you asking about?

14:12.020 --> 14:14.080
Why did His Majesty call him Mr. Fan?

14:14.100 --> 14:15.650
Mr. Fan?

14:17.170 --> 14:19.020
Does His Majesty of Beiqi

14:19.020 --> 14:21.270
usually call his ministers that way?

14:21.290 --> 14:22.890
Never.

14:23.820 --> 14:25.280
Then why?

14:26.100 --> 14:27.920
Then why?

14:28.050 --> 14:29.320
How could I know?

14:29.340 --> 14:31.890
Neither could us!

14:32.290 --> 14:33.840
Maybe, His Majesty of your country

14:34.100 --> 14:37.650
is courteous to men of talents.

14:48.730 --> 14:51.600
But he's too courteous.

15:02.610 --> 15:04.010
Mother,

15:04.050 --> 15:06.590
I'm so happy to see Fan Xian

15:06.610 --> 15:07.850
that I forgot about diplomatic etiquette.

15:07.850 --> 15:09.030
So happy?

15:09.050 --> 15:11.080
Please forgive me.

15:20.760 --> 15:23.310
=Empress Dowager of Beiqi=

15:30.440 --> 15:32.590
=Haitang Duoduo, Saintess of Beiqi=

15:46.730 --> 15:49.520
Are you the poetic genius of Nanqing?

15:50.610 --> 15:51.830
I'm too embarrassed

15:51.850 --> 15:53.810
to bear the title.

15:54.170 --> 15:56.130
Fan Xian pays respects to Your Majesty the Empress Dowager.

15:57.660 --> 15:59.160
Rise.

16:02.220 --> 16:05.130
His Majesty loves your poems.

16:07.530 --> 16:10.690
Your Majesty, what do you want to talk with him?

16:12.850 --> 16:15.040
Just talk about poems casually.

16:15.260 --> 16:17.480
Please allow us.

16:18.460 --> 16:19.910
You're the emperor.

16:19.930 --> 16:22.040
You can make the call.

16:22.490 --> 16:24.150
If you want to talk poems with him,

16:24.170 --> 16:26.160
just go ahead.

16:28.660 --> 16:31.920
The hall is too majestic. It's not a place to talk.

16:32.340 --> 16:34.880
I'd like to go out for a walk with Fan Xian.

16:34.900 --> 16:36.710
Mother, you must be tired after
handling all the political affairs.

16:36.730 --> 16:38.840
You'd better go back to your palace for a rest.

16:40.780 --> 16:43.130
Is the hall too majestic,

16:43.170 --> 16:46.770
or am I too majestic?

16:46.930 --> 16:48.800
Mother, it's known to the world that

16:48.820 --> 16:50.840
you're elegant and kind.

16:51.460 --> 16:52.680
Well then.

16:52.700 --> 16:54.260
Let me walk

16:54.260 --> 16:55.960
with you.

16:56.260 --> 16:59.480
Mother, you must be tired. How dare I bother you?

17:00.490 --> 17:02.770
That being said,

17:02.930 --> 17:06.010
I might as well go back to my palace.

17:07.410 --> 17:09.560
Your Auntie is here.

17:09.580 --> 17:11.480
If you want to talk casually,

17:12.290 --> 17:15.320
your Auntie can keep you company.

17:20.980 --> 17:23.250
Mother, see you.

17:28.860 --> 17:32.080
Auntie, when did you get back to Shangjing?

17:32.100 --> 17:33.480
I got back yesterday.

17:33.500 --> 17:36.150
My teacher is afraid there might be too
many villains in the imperial palace,

17:36.170 --> 17:37.910
so he sends me here.

17:37.930 --> 17:38.770
Villains?

17:38.770 --> 17:41.910
Yes, there are all kinds of villains in the world.

17:41.930 --> 17:43.680
Some are cunning and deceitful,

17:43.700 --> 17:45.440
some are shameless and insidious,

17:45.460 --> 17:48.600
and some may even drug others.

17:48.620 --> 17:50.130
It's impossible to guard against them.

18:51.620 --> 18:53.770
Let's have a rest here.

18:55.170 --> 18:56.750
Holding on to the balustrade clean,

18:56.770 --> 18:58.890
I feel the chill of the wind blowing watery smoke onto my face.

18:58.890 --> 19:00.600
Good!

19:00.980 --> 19:04.410
I sing aloud dispersing the fleeting clouds apace.

19:06.380 --> 19:09.720
Excellent! Wonderful!

19:11.220 --> 19:13.370
There are many people trying to flatter me.

19:14.250 --> 19:16.890
But Fan Xian, you're the first one

19:16.930 --> 19:19.840
to flatter me in a careless way.

19:20.010 --> 19:21.530
I'm really sorry.

19:23.580 --> 19:25.800
Auntie, you're seldom here.

19:25.860 --> 19:27.440
Now that you're here,

19:27.460 --> 19:29.770
you can appreciate the scenery.

19:31.740 --> 19:33.720
The imperial palace is so beautiful

19:34.220 --> 19:35.600
that I never thought of

19:35.620 --> 19:38.050
taking a walk outside the palace walls.

19:39.220 --> 19:40.510
Mr. Fan,

19:40.530 --> 19:42.600
how do you like the scenery here?

19:42.620 --> 19:43.680
Good.

19:43.700 --> 19:45.480
What is good?

19:47.700 --> 19:48.960
There are trees.

19:54.220 --> 19:55.800
You're so good at making compliments.

20:00.700 --> 20:02.650
Mr. Fan, do you know

20:02.930 --> 20:05.150
why I ask you to stay?

20:05.170 --> 20:06.840
Your Majesty, please tell me.

20:06.860 --> 20:08.290
There're two reasons.

20:08.620 --> 20:09.720
Firstly,

20:09.740 --> 20:11.750
I love your talent in literature.

20:11.770 --> 20:13.270
I can hardly bear to put down the Red Mansions

20:13.290 --> 20:15.200
written by you under a pseudonym.

20:16.170 --> 20:18.560
However, it does take a long time

20:18.580 --> 20:20.080
for you to release the new chapter.

20:20.100 --> 20:21.890
I'll try my best to finish it.

20:22.290 --> 20:24.480
Secondly, it's your poem collection.

20:24.500 --> 20:26.890
You actually composed so many marvelous poems overnight.

20:27.340 --> 20:29.410
Once it's released,

20:30.220 --> 20:32.370
even I dare not compose any poems.

20:33.220 --> 20:34.910
I'm so flattered,

20:34.930 --> 20:36.270
but your Majesty's poem is really good.

20:36.290 --> 20:37.890
Take a seat.

20:44.860 --> 20:47.130
Actually, there's another reason.

20:48.860 --> 20:50.990
Mr. Fan, you went all the way up north.

20:51.010 --> 20:53.030
How do you like the scenery in Beiqi?

20:53.050 --> 20:55.720
The scenery is picturesque and the land
is endowed with nature's treasures.

20:55.820 --> 20:57.290
How is it compared to Nanqing?

20:57.290 --> 20:58.010
It's far better.

20:58.010 --> 20:58.770
The palace walls of Nanqing

20:58.770 --> 20:59.960
are much lower

20:59.980 --> 21:00.620
and closer to ditches,

21:00.620 --> 21:02.200
which smell like horse urine.

21:07.890 --> 21:09.600
When Auntie said you're a rascal,

21:09.620 --> 21:11.170
I didn't believe her.

21:11.580 --> 21:14.370
Today by meeting you in person, I think she's right about you.

21:17.340 --> 21:18.510
It should be the first time

21:18.530 --> 21:20.150
for me to meet your Auntie.

21:20.170 --> 21:21.890
How could she make such a comment?

21:22.340 --> 21:23.720
You really haven't met her before?

21:24.170 --> 21:25.720
No.

21:26.380 --> 21:29.050
She's Haitang. Do you remember?

21:31.130 --> 21:32.870
So she's Miss Haitang,

21:32.890 --> 21:34.150
the Beiqi Saintess.

21:34.170 --> 21:35.960
I've heard so much of you!

21:37.930 --> 21:39.220
In my opinion, Mr. Fan,

21:39.220 --> 21:40.930
you must have a poor memory.

21:43.530 --> 21:45.410
It really is my first time

21:45.410 --> 21:46.620
to meet her.

21:46.620 --> 21:48.890
How could you forget your recent fight in the stone forest?

21:50.340 --> 21:52.230
You drugged her, remember?

21:52.250 --> 21:53.720
How do you...

21:54.170 --> 21:55.930
You also told her that

21:56.220 --> 21:58.150
you would help her and my mother

21:58.170 --> 22:00.960
take over power from me.

22:02.290 --> 22:03.170
To help you and the Empress Dowager

22:03.170 --> 22:05.270
take over power from your little emperor.

22:05.290 --> 22:06.560
Who told you I'm with the Empress Dowager.

22:06.580 --> 22:08.600
Your teacher Ku He is the Imperial Tutor.

22:08.620 --> 22:09.840
He certainly has to take side.

22:09.860 --> 22:12.530
One force is led by the little emperor.
One force is led by the Empress Dowager.

22:12.770 --> 22:14.110
And the other is led by Shangshan Hu,

22:14.130 --> 22:15.680
which remains neutral.

22:15.930 --> 22:17.600
Shangshan Hu wants to save Xiao En,

22:17.620 --> 22:18.750
while you want to kill him.

22:18.770 --> 22:20.230
You're certainly not on the same side.

22:20.250 --> 22:22.170
I could also be a follower of His Majesty.

22:23.050 --> 22:24.980
You thought I wouldn't order Auntie

22:24.980 --> 22:26.560
to attack in Nanqing,

22:26.580 --> 22:28.840
so you believed she's with my mother.

22:30.820 --> 22:32.510
I cry, "Can't you see? Can't you see?

22:32.530 --> 22:34.840
The green leaves are fresh but the red flowers are fading!"

22:35.770 --> 22:37.200
What a wonderful poem!

22:38.980 --> 22:39.740
So you're not...

22:39.740 --> 22:41.440
You actually guessed wrong.

22:41.460 --> 22:44.030
You seem to serve the Empress Dowager, but...

22:44.050 --> 22:45.890
But she's actually on my side.

22:55.220 --> 22:57.170
Does anyone else know about this?

22:57.620 --> 22:59.030
In the imperial palace,

22:59.050 --> 23:01.650
no one knows but the three of us.

23:10.010 --> 23:11.380
His Majesty only loves

23:11.380 --> 23:13.030
Fan Xian's literary talent,

23:13.050 --> 23:14.890
so he keeps Fan Xian for a casual talk.

23:14.930 --> 23:16.650
No need to be worried.

23:17.530 --> 23:18.170
But Fan Xian is also

23:18.170 --> 23:20.840
the Director-General of the Investigator's Office.

23:20.890 --> 23:22.840
He's very resourceful.

23:22.980 --> 23:25.440
If he meets alone with His Majesty,

23:26.820 --> 23:27.620
I'm afraid...

23:27.620 --> 23:29.720
I asked Haitang to keep them company.

23:31.620 --> 23:33.130
If the Saintess is with them,

23:33.650 --> 23:35.030
it should be fine.

23:35.050 --> 23:36.720
With Haitang by their side,

23:36.740 --> 23:39.960
His Majesty won't be able

23:39.980 --> 23:42.200
to tell Fan Xian any secret.

23:57.340 --> 23:59.840
Mr. Fan, are you nervous?

23:59.860 --> 24:02.270
By telling me such an important secret,

24:02.290 --> 24:04.370
I'm afraid Your Majesty might kill me next.

24:05.050 --> 24:06.360
If I kill you,

24:06.380 --> 24:08.440
who can finish writing the Red Mansions?

24:12.460 --> 24:14.460
If you have any question, just feel free to ask.

24:14.460 --> 24:15.980
Your Majesty, did you give the order

24:15.980 --> 24:17.010
to kill Xiao En?

24:17.010 --> 24:18.530
What about Si Lili then?

24:19.050 --> 24:20.080
I didn't give the order.

24:20.100 --> 24:21.840
That's an order from my teacher.

24:21.860 --> 24:23.530
His Majesty has nothing to do with it.

24:23.740 --> 24:25.480
Your relationship network in Beiqi is really complicated.

24:25.500 --> 24:26.840
Indeed!

24:27.740 --> 24:29.100
Your Majesty, you told me

24:29.100 --> 24:29.840
the secret,

24:29.860 --> 24:30.770
yet you spare my life.

24:30.770 --> 24:31.910
What are you up to?

24:31.930 --> 24:33.510
Don't you want to find an ally?

24:33.530 --> 24:34.870
You can help anyone.

24:34.890 --> 24:36.480
Why not help me?

24:37.290 --> 24:39.440
Your Majesty, what can I do for you?

24:39.500 --> 24:40.650
Shen Zhong

24:40.650 --> 24:43.390
enjoys great power and has followers everywhere.

24:43.410 --> 24:45.530
Yet he's extremely loyal to my mother.

24:45.890 --> 24:48.100
I remember that Shen Zhong

24:48.100 --> 24:49.130
killed a mammy from the imperial palace

24:49.130 --> 24:50.010
at the border.

24:50.010 --> 24:52.080
She was an old servant of the Empress Dowager of your country.

24:52.100 --> 24:54.010
How can he be called loyal?

24:54.220 --> 24:56.080
I've figured it out.

24:56.700 --> 24:57.740
The family of the mammy

24:57.740 --> 25:00.030
have received a large sum of money recently.

25:00.050 --> 25:01.560
Tracing the source, it was paid

25:01.650 --> 25:04.390
by Ceremonial Propriety Division.

25:04.410 --> 25:06.110
His Majesty bought her over?

25:06.130 --> 25:09.010
We should get rid of her.

25:11.860 --> 25:14.410
Though His Majesty is young,

25:14.580 --> 25:17.720
he's really shrewd and deep.

25:18.130 --> 25:20.600
Why can't he see that

25:20.770 --> 25:21.890
everything I've done

25:21.890 --> 25:24.800
is for protecting Beiqi?

25:24.820 --> 25:28.290
Your Majesty, you're definitely doing everything for the country.

25:30.010 --> 25:31.720
By killing her,

25:31.770 --> 25:34.510
His Majesty won't be happy.

25:34.530 --> 25:36.510
I can't help with that.

25:36.530 --> 25:37.580
I only want to clean up

25:37.580 --> 25:40.050
the traitors around Your Majesty.

25:46.650 --> 25:47.250
Then why not

25:47.250 --> 25:49.010
dismiss him from his post?

25:50.930 --> 25:53.290
By dismissing him, the whole situation will be affected.

25:53.650 --> 25:55.720
Shen Zhong has many connections,

25:55.740 --> 25:57.480
and he is shielded by my mother.

25:57.500 --> 25:59.080
It's by no means easy.

25:59.770 --> 26:01.560
Then how will I be able to help?

26:01.580 --> 26:03.380
Mr. Fan, you protected the battle flag

26:03.380 --> 26:04.800
all the way into the imperial palace with only one sword.

26:04.820 --> 26:06.460
You also killed Cheng Jushu

26:06.460 --> 26:08.200
in the capital city of Nanqing.

26:09.580 --> 26:12.840
Skilled as you are, it won't be difficult

26:13.410 --> 26:15.200
for you to kill Shen Zhong, right?

26:16.860 --> 26:18.410
Miss Haitang is exceptionally good at martial arts.

26:18.410 --> 26:20.370
She is a better killer than I am.

26:21.380 --> 26:23.200
If Auntie kills him,

26:23.220 --> 26:24.990
will my mother still believe her?

26:25.010 --> 26:25.700
Your Majesty, don't you have

26:25.700 --> 26:27.440
other martial arts masters at your command?

26:27.460 --> 26:28.440
Shen Zhong is thoroughly

26:28.460 --> 26:30.080
familiar with my men.

26:30.100 --> 26:32.530
Whenever they move, he'll be vigilant right away.

26:33.500 --> 26:34.930
I see.

26:35.500 --> 26:37.230
So I'm the best choice.

26:37.250 --> 26:38.840
I'm from Nanqing.

26:38.860 --> 26:40.460
If Shen Zhong is killed by me,

26:40.460 --> 26:42.320
no one will suspect Your Majesty.

26:42.340 --> 26:43.460
That's right.

26:43.460 --> 26:45.290
Then by cutting off my head in public,

26:45.290 --> 26:46.700
Your Majesty can draw people over to your side,

26:46.700 --> 26:48.230
and I will die in a strange land.

26:48.250 --> 26:49.860
What a good story of

26:49.860 --> 26:51.890
helping each other!

26:55.220 --> 26:58.770
Mr. Fan, are you refusing my offer?

26:59.530 --> 27:01.960
Why should I take the risk?

27:03.580 --> 27:05.320
Why do you come to Beiqi?

27:05.340 --> 27:07.440
To return Xiao En and take Yan Bingyun back.

27:07.460 --> 27:09.290
Yan Bingyun is in Shen Zhong's hands.

27:09.290 --> 27:10.720
But he will release Yan Bingyun sooner or later.

27:10.740 --> 27:11.910
Even the Empress Dowager of your country

27:11.930 --> 27:13.480
does not want another war, right?

27:13.500 --> 27:14.560
Yan Bingyun will be released,

27:14.580 --> 27:15.910
but it's hard to tell when.

27:15.930 --> 27:16.890
Then how could he

27:16.890 --> 27:18.320
keep me in Shangjing?

27:18.340 --> 27:19.580
You should ask him about that.

27:19.580 --> 27:21.480
Fine, I'll leave and ask him now.

27:21.500 --> 27:23.220
Your Majesty, if you don't want to kill me,

27:23.220 --> 27:24.680
I'll leave now.

27:25.930 --> 27:27.320
Auntie,

27:27.460 --> 27:30.010
escort Mr. Fan out for me.

27:31.460 --> 27:33.130
Your Majesty, I bid you farewell.

27:33.820 --> 27:35.440
We'll meet again.

27:52.620 --> 27:53.840
What's so funny?

27:55.050 --> 27:56.320
I remember that

27:56.340 --> 27:58.050
when country women feel lazy,

27:58.050 --> 27:59.800
they may walk like this.

27:59.930 --> 28:01.560
I'm also lazy. Is that funny?

28:01.580 --> 28:03.050
I love your posture.

28:09.740 --> 28:12.010
If I'm not honest, I'll be condemned by the God.

28:15.890 --> 28:16.980
I thought Your Majesty

28:16.980 --> 28:17.930
wouldn't let me leave.

28:17.930 --> 28:18.960
Why?

28:18.980 --> 28:20.530
Because I've known your secret.

28:20.620 --> 28:21.720
He loves your book,

28:21.740 --> 28:22.870
so he won't kill you.

28:22.890 --> 28:23.680
Isn't that an excuse?

28:23.700 --> 28:24.890
No.

28:25.860 --> 28:27.560
You talk less than before.

28:27.580 --> 28:28.720
Weren't it for the same walking posture,

28:28.740 --> 28:30.170
I wouldn't recognize you.

28:34.250 --> 28:35.510
I'm the Saintess.

28:35.530 --> 28:36.930
How could I be saint if I talk too much?

28:37.100 --> 28:38.800
Do you care about others' opinions?

28:41.100 --> 28:42.010
My teacher asks me to behave like

28:42.010 --> 28:43.560
a Saintess in the imperial palace,

28:43.770 --> 28:45.410
so I don't like to come here.

28:45.700 --> 28:46.500
When you're with me,

28:46.500 --> 28:47.890
you don't have to restrain yourself.

28:48.770 --> 28:50.440
Are we friends?

28:50.460 --> 28:51.720
You even drugged me!

28:51.740 --> 28:52.820
If you really mind it so much,

28:52.820 --> 28:54.290
you can also drug me.

28:55.380 --> 28:56.770
Yes, I can.

28:57.100 --> 28:58.290
There aren't many drugs in the world

28:58.290 --> 28:59.650
which can affect me.

29:00.170 --> 29:02.200
Just wait. I'll have a try.

29:02.220 --> 29:03.500
Then you should hurry up.

29:03.500 --> 29:04.740
I'll go back to Nanqing

29:04.740 --> 29:06.250
right after getting Yan Bingyun.

29:08.410 --> 29:09.390
His Majesty said

29:09.410 --> 29:10.680
you won't be able to go back for the moment.

29:10.700 --> 29:12.170
Shen Zhong won't give Yan Bingyun

29:12.170 --> 29:13.560
to you easily.

29:16.130 --> 29:17.930
Your Majesty is too young

29:17.930 --> 29:19.360
to understand political affairs.

29:19.380 --> 29:20.890
If he wants to keep me in Shangjing,

29:20.890 --> 29:22.010
he has to find an excuse.

29:22.010 --> 29:22.980
He can't keep me by force.

29:22.980 --> 29:24.410
That excuse should be sensible

29:24.410 --> 29:26.480
and acceptable to both our countries.

29:27.010 --> 29:28.010
It's not easy

29:28.010 --> 29:30.250
to find such an excuse.

29:34.130 --> 29:35.320
What did you say?

29:35.340 --> 29:37.990
Our Empress Dowager's birthday is around the corner.

29:38.010 --> 29:39.600
Your Excellency, you can take the chance and stay a little longer

29:39.620 --> 29:41.250
to congratulate Her Majesty,

29:41.290 --> 29:43.510
thus promoting the friendship between our courtiers.

29:43.530 --> 29:45.270
I'm here with a task.

29:45.290 --> 29:46.680
It's approved by your country.

29:46.700 --> 29:48.110
By whom?

29:48.130 --> 29:49.440
Wait a moment.

29:50.290 --> 29:51.440
Officials,

29:52.010 --> 29:53.770
you can go back to your residence first

29:53.770 --> 29:55.650
with other mission members.

29:55.820 --> 29:58.250
I'll take a walk with His Excellency.

30:10.170 --> 30:12.270
Your Majesty, Minister Fan is here.

30:12.290 --> 30:13.560
Let him in.

30:19.930 --> 30:22.720
What's up, Head Chen?

30:22.740 --> 30:25.250
Did you know in advance that I would come and visit?

30:26.700 --> 30:28.530
How could I know that?

30:28.700 --> 30:30.680
It's prepared by me.

30:31.890 --> 30:32.960
Your Majesty,

30:32.980 --> 30:34.510
Beiqi wants to keep Fan Xian there.

30:34.530 --> 30:36.440
They're obviously up to something.

30:36.460 --> 30:37.530
The longer he stays in the capital of

30:37.530 --> 30:39.750
the enemy country, the more risky it'll be.

30:39.770 --> 30:42.110
How could you grant their request?

30:42.130 --> 30:43.800
Sit down and fish with me.

31:07.890 --> 31:09.130
To keep the mission,

31:09.130 --> 31:10.700
we certainly have to gain approval

31:10.700 --> 31:12.170
from your emperor.

31:13.100 --> 31:15.650
Your Excellency, do you want to defy the imperial order?

31:16.410 --> 31:18.320
If so, you won't be able to

31:18.340 --> 31:20.130
stay in Nanqing anymore,

31:20.250 --> 31:22.050
please feel free to

31:22.050 --> 31:23.560
join us in Beiqi anytime.

31:23.770 --> 31:26.250
You're welcome to forsake darkness for light.

31:27.340 --> 31:28.870
I can stay for the birthday,

31:28.890 --> 31:30.130
but you should let me

31:30.130 --> 31:31.530
take back Yan Bingyun first.

31:34.050 --> 31:34.990
Let's talk about hostage exchange till

31:35.010 --> 31:37.080
you're heading back to Nanqing.

31:37.340 --> 31:39.840
Your Excellency, do you want to detain him?

31:41.010 --> 31:42.680
I still have some questions for him.

31:42.700 --> 31:44.320
Your Excellency, please wait a little longer.

31:44.340 --> 31:45.890
Then let me see him first.

31:45.980 --> 31:47.230
Fine.

31:47.250 --> 31:48.840
I'll arrange it for you gradually.

31:50.130 --> 31:51.210
When can I see him?

31:52.100 --> 31:55.050
No hurry. The procedures are complicated.

31:55.100 --> 31:57.230
Your Excellency, you should wait patiently.

31:57.250 --> 31:59.050
What if I want to see him now?

32:03.700 --> 32:04.960
Then Your Excellency,

32:04.980 --> 32:07.130
you'd better look for him yourself.

32:16.220 --> 32:18.360
Don't push! Don't push! Listen to me!

32:18.380 --> 32:20.770
His Excellency is not here.

32:21.250 --> 32:24.130
He's really not here!

32:24.860 --> 32:27.530
Your Excellency, what does that mean?

32:27.980 --> 32:29.080
Throwing a sword at someone's feet

32:29.100 --> 32:30.620
is a custom of Beiqi.

32:30.620 --> 32:32.770
It means challenging the mission for a fight.

32:32.770 --> 32:34.130
Your Excellency, word has spread so fast

32:34.130 --> 32:35.200
that you protected the battle flag with only one sword.

32:35.220 --> 32:36.290
Now those who want to challenge you

32:36.290 --> 32:37.870
are coming one after another.

32:37.890 --> 32:40.800
Your Excellency, take care. See you.

32:51.100 --> 32:53.560
So you're Fan Xian.

32:53.580 --> 32:55.370
I want to challenge you.

33:01.860 --> 33:03.720
Your Excellency, if we don't fight,

33:03.740 --> 33:05.960
we'll be regarded as admitting defeat.

33:05.980 --> 33:08.320
Then we'll be utterly discredited.

33:10.820 --> 33:11.800
Gao.

33:11.820 --> 33:12.600
Yes.

33:12.620 --> 33:14.130
Dare you fight them?

33:15.700 --> 33:17.080
Fine!

33:19.340 --> 33:20.460
Mom! Mom!

33:20.460 --> 33:22.750
What are they doing?

33:22.770 --> 33:24.320
Let's go! Come on!

33:24.340 --> 33:26.480
It's over there! Right ahead!

33:31.820 --> 33:38.890
Good! Good! Good!

33:55.050 --> 33:56.320
Thank you!

34:42.290 --> 34:44.000
107.

34:44.580 --> 34:46.170
108.

34:46.530 --> 34:48.210
109.

34:49.940 --> 34:51.230
141.

34:51.250 --> 34:52.800
142.

34:54.340 --> 34:55.800
143.

34:55.820 --> 34:57.240
144.

34:57.290 --> 34:58.760
145.

35:49.380 --> 35:50.750
We want to fight Fan Xian!

35:50.770 --> 35:52.230
We want to fight Fan Xian!

35:52.250 --> 35:57.730
We want to fight Fan Xian!

35:59.660 --> 36:01.840
Beat me first,

36:01.860 --> 36:03.840
and then you can make requests.

36:05.450 --> 36:07.320
Who's next?

36:23.210 --> 36:24.990
If you don't calm down,

36:25.010 --> 36:27.080
fish won't bite.

36:31.210 --> 36:32.650
It's been quite a while,

36:32.900 --> 36:35.280
but Your Majesty, you haven't got a fish, either.

36:35.380 --> 36:37.520
There's no fish in the lake.

36:37.690 --> 36:39.270
Then what are we

36:39.290 --> 36:41.170
fishing for here?

36:41.900 --> 36:43.760
Our past.

36:54.180 --> 36:55.360
You can have that.

36:55.380 --> 36:56.840
I don't want that.

36:57.100 --> 36:58.760
I've got a fish!

37:01.340 --> 37:02.290
You're so clumsy!

37:02.290 --> 37:03.930
You don't know how to fish!

37:07.860 --> 37:09.410
I want one, too!

37:12.290 --> 37:13.490
Give me another!

37:15.660 --> 37:16.710
Have you forgotten?

37:16.730 --> 37:18.770
We used to fish here

37:18.770 --> 37:20.240
together.

37:21.730 --> 37:23.410
Just like old times,

37:23.770 --> 37:25.450
it's still the three of us.

37:25.820 --> 37:27.490
It's different.

37:27.580 --> 37:31.170
Except Your Majesty, we're all old.

37:31.250 --> 37:32.930
What do you mean?

37:32.970 --> 37:35.560
Do you mean that I'm an evil spirit that doesn't age?

37:35.580 --> 37:37.450
Your Majesty, as the son of Heaven,

37:37.450 --> 37:39.840
you're exceptionally good at handling
things and making decisions.

37:39.860 --> 37:42.320
How can we be the same?

37:42.340 --> 37:44.000
He's complaining.

37:44.250 --> 37:46.030
I just don't get it.

37:46.050 --> 37:47.340
Why don't you let Fan Xian

37:47.340 --> 37:49.080
come back earlier?

37:49.940 --> 37:51.620
Do you want Fan Xian

37:51.620 --> 37:53.320
to take over the Neiku?

37:53.530 --> 37:56.230
After all, it's the property of his mom.

37:56.250 --> 37:57.600
Chen Pingping,

37:57.770 --> 37:59.100
do you want Fan Xian

37:59.100 --> 38:00.970
to take over the Investigator's Office?

38:01.660 --> 38:03.450
I'm old.

38:03.660 --> 38:05.600
He's perfect for the post.

38:05.820 --> 38:07.430
He's good,

38:07.450 --> 38:09.490
but he's far from

38:09.490 --> 38:10.970
perfect.

38:11.530 --> 38:13.770
Do you know

38:13.770 --> 38:16.280
what his biggest problem is?

38:16.450 --> 38:18.750
His casual personality.

38:18.770 --> 38:20.130
He's too emotional.

38:21.420 --> 38:22.600
Neither.

38:22.620 --> 38:24.650
His life is too smooth.

38:25.010 --> 38:26.880
Overprotected by you, he has sailed through life

38:26.900 --> 38:29.410
without ever hitting the rough waters.

38:29.820 --> 38:32.210
Without facing mortal danger,

38:32.730 --> 38:33.490
how can he become

38:33.490 --> 38:35.970
the most powerful minister in the world?

38:36.580 --> 38:38.670
Your Majesty, you leave him in Beiqi

38:38.690 --> 38:40.210
so that he can improve himself

38:40.210 --> 38:41.600
through conspiracies and plots of the enemy country.

38:42.100 --> 38:44.280
What if something bad happens to him?

38:46.100 --> 38:48.270
Beiqi is weak after losing the war.

38:48.290 --> 38:49.690
Under this circumstance,

38:49.970 --> 38:51.430
he might go through hardships,

38:51.450 --> 38:53.160
but he won't die.

38:53.180 --> 38:54.650
Your Majesty,

38:55.290 --> 38:57.490
it's your last test for him.

39:01.770 --> 39:05.930
It's too risky after all.

39:05.970 --> 39:07.760
Learn from Chen Pingping.

39:07.970 --> 39:10.840
You have to be hard-hearted to make achievements.

39:14.530 --> 39:16.410
There's really fish here.

39:21.140 --> 39:22.860
Shen Zhong wants to hold me

39:22.860 --> 39:24.370
with the "attrition warfare" approach.

39:24.900 --> 39:26.250
Luckily, Gao can fight them

39:26.250 --> 39:27.840
on your behalf.

39:27.860 --> 39:29.320
By refusing to release Yan Bingyun,

39:29.340 --> 39:30.340
Shen Zhong surely wants to interrogate him

39:30.340 --> 39:32.410
and get information about our intelligent
network in Shangjing Town.

39:32.530 --> 39:34.840
I'm afraid Mr. Yan will have to suffer.

39:34.860 --> 39:36.140
So we must save him

39:36.140 --> 39:37.520
as soon as possible.

39:37.970 --> 39:39.270
But Shangjing Town is so big.

39:39.290 --> 39:40.640
How can we find out

39:40.660 --> 39:42.400
where Embroidered Uniform Guards keep him?

39:42.420 --> 39:44.280
We should wait for help?

39:44.940 --> 39:46.240
From whom?

40:11.050 --> 40:11.970
How do you like it here?

40:11.970 --> 40:13.690
Cut the crap!

40:14.690 --> 40:15.530
Shangjing Town is the base camp

40:15.530 --> 40:17.030
of Embroidered Uniform Guards.

40:17.050 --> 40:19.000
It's inconvenient for Wang Qinian and I to appear in public.

40:19.340 --> 40:20.340
Now you're the only one

40:20.340 --> 40:21.560
remaining hidden.

40:21.580 --> 40:23.000
We have to count on you.

40:23.210 --> 40:24.360
What do you want me to do?

40:24.380 --> 40:25.840
Chat with people on the street,

40:25.860 --> 40:26.530
trying to find out the location

40:26.530 --> 40:27.710
of Embroidered Uniform Guards Prison.

40:27.730 --> 40:29.280
Prison?

40:30.140 --> 40:31.890
I need to find Yan Bingyun.

40:33.100 --> 40:34.160
You promised me that

40:34.180 --> 40:36.560
you'll save my dad after completing your task.

40:36.580 --> 40:37.800
Yes.

40:53.210 --> 40:54.180
Follow him.

40:54.180 --> 40:55.560
I'll watch here.

41:03.180 --> 41:04.560
Prison.

41:04.940 --> 41:06.600
Embroidered Uniform Guards Prison.

41:19.620 --> 41:20.840
Your Excellency.

41:22.010 --> 41:23.190
How's it going?

41:23.210 --> 41:24.560
Fan Xian and Wang Qinian sneaked to

41:24.580 --> 41:27.130
Tiaowang Inn south of the Town.

41:28.490 --> 41:29.530
When entering the town,

41:29.530 --> 41:32.160
the man slipped away from the Nanqing mission

41:32.180 --> 41:34.320
is hiding in that inn, right?

41:34.450 --> 41:35.640
Exactly.

41:35.660 --> 41:37.250
Now Fan Xian and Wang Qinian

41:37.250 --> 41:38.520
are hiding in the room,

41:38.660 --> 41:40.250
while that man hidden in advance

41:40.250 --> 41:41.970
sneaked out of the inn secretly.

41:42.100 --> 41:45.270
He's smart to plan in advance.

41:45.290 --> 41:46.530
But Shangjing Town

41:46.530 --> 41:48.760
is controlled by us.

41:49.050 --> 41:50.670
Follow the man who sneaked out of the Inn.

41:50.690 --> 41:52.210
Yes.

41:55.770 --> 41:57.490
Haven't you finished the alteration?

41:59.530 --> 42:01.800
Your Excellency, please give me more days.

42:02.100 --> 42:03.970
I still need to alter some parts.

42:05.820 --> 42:08.100
Fine, as you wish.

42:08.100 --> 42:09.180
Yes.

42:10.140 --> 42:13.000
Your Excellency, it's not right.

42:14.380 --> 42:15.650
What's wrong?

42:18.940 --> 42:20.800
They're watching us outside.

42:21.010 --> 42:21.770
According to years of experience

42:21.770 --> 42:23.270
in tracking and sneaking,

42:23.290 --> 42:24.710
I can't be wrong.

42:24.730 --> 42:26.800
It's the Shangjing Town of Beiqi.

42:26.820 --> 42:27.940
It's their job

42:27.940 --> 42:29.670
to watch us.

42:29.690 --> 42:30.600
Your Excellency,

42:30.620 --> 42:32.100
Guo Baokun was followed

42:32.100 --> 42:33.560
when he left just now.

42:33.580 --> 42:35.050
I'm afraid Guo Baokun

42:35.050 --> 42:36.450
is exposed.

42:37.940 --> 42:39.490
Of course he is.

43:03.880 --> 43:07.460
In the river of history,

43:07.480 --> 43:10.950
time goes round and round.

43:13.760 --> 43:17.100
Memories about the former and present lives

43:17.120 --> 43:21.190
join each other in an endless way.

43:23.080 --> 43:25.700
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:25.720 --> 43:27.960
one season follows another in a flash,

43:27.960 --> 43:30.460
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:30.480 --> 43:32.080
I just can't give up

43:32.080 --> 43:35.420
to be with you for my whole life.

43:35.440 --> 43:40.910
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:42.160 --> 43:44.710
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:45.000 --> 43:47.040
Year after year in the wandering,

43:47.040 --> 43:49.700
I count the remaining years.

43:49.720 --> 43:51.900
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:51.920 --> 43:53.910
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:54.200 --> 43:56.590
I never feel regretful.

43:56.640 --> 43:58.000
In such a chaotic world,

43:58.000 --> 44:00.980
I still miss you as ever.

44:01.000 --> 44:03.950
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:04.240 --> 44:06.300
With a gentle heart,

44:06.320 --> 44:08.980
I cherish our remaining years.

44:09.000 --> 44:10.520
Even though we have to go through

44:10.520 --> 44:13.030
all the hardships along the journey,

44:13.160 --> 44:20.350
you always stay by my side,

44:20.440 --> 44:23.110
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:23.400 --> 44:25.480
Year after year in the wandering,

44:25.480 --> 44:28.140
I count the remaining years.

44:28.160 --> 44:30.300
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:30.320 --> 44:32.550
even though we end up the destiny,

44:32.760 --> 44:34.940
I never feel regretful.

44:34.960 --> 44:36.360
In such a chaotic world,

44:36.360 --> 44:39.420
I still miss you as ever.

44:39.440 --> 44:42.550
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:42.640 --> 44:44.780
With a gentle heart,

44:44.800 --> 44:47.500
I cherish our remaining years.

44:47.520 --> 44:48.960
Even though we have to go through

44:48.960 --> 44:51.620
all the hardships along the journey,

44:51.640 --> 45:00.400
you always stay by my side.
